e}</strong><small>${u.rank} · ${nodes[u.node].name}</small></div><span>${u.strength}%</span></div>`).join('')}</div>${state.reinforcements?`<button class="action-button" data-recruit style="width:100%;margin-top:8px">＋ &nbsp; REQUEST REINFORCEMENTS <small>1 AVAILABLE · COST 15 SUPPLY</small></button>`:''}<div class="selected-box"><h3>${unit?unit.name+' · '+target.name:target.name}</h3><p>${unit?`${unit.strength}% strength · ${unit.morale}% morale · ${unit.orders?'ORDER ASSIGNED':'AWAITING ORDERS'}<br>${target.description}`:`${target.description}<br>Select a unit, then choose its order.`}</p></div><div class="order-actions"><button class="action-button" data-order="advance" ${!unit||unit.orders||!target||!nodes[unit.node].neighbors.includes(selectedNode)||state.supply<8?'disabled':''}>↗ &nbsp; ADVANCE</button><button class="action-button" data-order="entrench" ${!unit||unit.orders?'disabled':''}>⌂ &nbsp; ENTRENCH</button><button class="action-button" data-order="resupply" ${!unit||unit.orders||state.supply<10?'disabled':''}>＋ &nbsp; RESUPPLY</button><button class="action-button" data-order="hold" ${!unit||unit.orders?'disabled':''}>◈ &nbsp; HOLD POSITION</button></div><button class="resolve-button" data-resolve ${!pending.length?'disabled':''}>${pending.length?'RESOLVE ORDERS · '+pending.length+' QUEUED':'ISSUE ORDERS TO PROCEED'}</button><div class="log-wrap"><div class="panel-heading">FIELD DISPATCHES</div><div class="event-log">${state.log.slice(-5).reverse().map(line=>`<div>${line}</div>`).join('')}</div></div></aside></div>${state.won||state.lost?`<div class="modal-backdrop"><div class="modal"><div class="modal-kicker">${state.won?'OBJECTIVE SECURED':'BRIGADE STATUS'}</div><h2>${state.won?'The line moves east.':'A costly retreat.'}</h2><p class="modal-copy">${state.won?'Your brigade has taken both Varennes and the Metz Road. The dispatch is sent; your men will be remembered.':'The brigade can no longer hold the sector. The war continues, but your command is relieved.'}</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="modal-primary" data-return>RETURN TO MENU</button><button class="modal-secondary" data-continue>CONTINUE CAMPAIGN</button></div></div></div>`:''}`;

